WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,700
You don’t know our silly wanderer

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:03,820
I was deceived by that guy.

3
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:06,700
You're so angry, I'm not stupid

4
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,020
They are all bad people, so bad

5
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:10,540
I don’t know which girl it is

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,700
Listen to me, after that guy dies

7
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,620
His worried face turned pale

8
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:17,270
If you really like it

9
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:19,070
But we must let Sanniang

10
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:22,740
Help you take good care of the princess

11
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,420
Miss you

12
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:31,310
It's getting late

13
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:32,790
Mingyue, you are sick

14
00:00:32,790 --> 00:00:33,870
Just go to bed early

15
00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:37,340
It's time for You'er and I to leave, right?

16
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:41,380
I asked someone to send you into trouble

17
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,900
All of you, get out

18
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:49,500
I'm going to have a rest

19
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:51,180
Yes, Your Highness the Princess

20
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:53,960
What you just said to your friend

21
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:56,980
If you have a good attitude, it's not as good as yours in the future.

22
00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:59,020
Talk to me in that tone too
